@title New cabinet: the maker's STEP file for the picked enclosure matches, sizes become STEP values
@area Cabinet
# Where the user finds it: Outline > New cabinet > Enclosure > Choose file... (or drop the STEP file on the zone).
user_catalog qa/fixtures/enclosure-parts.json
fresh
key ctrl+n
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
click_text "New cabinet..." Button
wait 10
click_text "Demo TS-600x1800x500"
wait 6
shot a-picked
answer_dialog qa/fixtures/enclosure-step/TS-600x1800x500.stp
click_text "Choose file…" Button
wait 30
expect "TS-600x1800x500.stp"
expect "matches"
expect "600 x 1800 x 500 mm"
shot b-step-read
check_layout
key Enter
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 20
shot c-cabinet-view
